# Settings > Terminal > Local shell > Git Bash. Run once after `start` (the probe starts with an
# empty data directory). Clicks are logical pixels inside the window at the default `place`
# size; they depend on the layout, so `shot` is taken after every click to make a miss visible.
# The settings gear is the last icon of the title bar's right group (logical 836,18).
place
focus
sleep 500
keys {ESC}
clickw 836 18
sleep 1000
shot gb-1
